        ("The four-tier institutional chain", "The institutional chain runs from the Prime Minister's Human Resources Council for apex guidance, through the Cabinet Secretariat Coordination Unit, to the Capacity Building Commission for standards, Annual Capacity Building Plans and institutional capacity, and finally to Karmayogi Bharat, the government-owned special purpose vehicle that operates the online platform, so describing the Commission as the sole implementing or platform-operating body is inaccurate."),
