        (10, "Explain why political neutrality, permanence and anonymity were designed as a single package rather than as three separate virtues of the Indian civil service.", "The three traits are interlocking rather than additive, because neutrality without tenure security is unenforceable, permanence without neutrality is merely entrenchment and anonymity without internal accountability is impunity, so weakening any one destabilises the other two and the package rather than the list is what the demand is testing.", [0, 1, 2, 3]),
